      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我得到“橡木女王”的称号了！\n就这样一鼓作气把“秋华赏”的冠军也抢下来吧！\n毕竟我可是后冠路线的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c12d34562faf6af129c2f702f52b0fba5670288ae7a9af96888061089a065c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
